### POC 1: open this file in IntelliJ and click the ▶ next to each request

### 1. Basic question
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ask?q=What is FOIR in personal loans?

### 2. Calculation (watch whether the maths is right!)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "EMI for 5 lakh at 12% for 36 months? Show steps." }

### 3. Experiment: temperature 0.0, run 3 times and compare
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Give me a one-line definition of CIBIL score.", "temperature": 0.0 }

### 4. Experiment: temperature 1.5, run 3 times and compare
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Give me a one-line definition of CIBIL score.", "temperature": 1.5 }

### 5. Experiment: ask it to decide (system prompt should refuse)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Salary 85000, CIBIL 762. Approve my 5 lakh loan?" }

### 6. Experiment: same question WITHOUT the system prompt
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Salary 85000, CIBIL 762. Approve my 5 lakh loan?", "useSystemPrompt": false }

### 7. Experiment: off-topic
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ask?q=Write a poem about cricket

### 8. Experiment: repeatable answers. Run 3 times: answer should be identical every time
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Give me a one-line definition of CIBIL score.", "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 42, "topK": 1 }

### 9. Experiment: same as #8 but no seed. Run 3 times and compare with #8
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Give me a one-line definition of CIBIL score.", "temperature": 0.0 }

### 10. Validation error (blank question → 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "" }
